WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.417
An equation says two quantities are equal. Use inverse operations to solve for the

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:05.789
unknown.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:14.275
Solve x plus 11 equals 33. The answer is 22. x equals 33 minus 11 equals 22.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:20.798
A box during a sports day has 11 stickers plus x more; altogether there are 34. What

00:00:20.798 --> 00:00:23.138
is x? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:30.345
A box during a sports day has 11 stickers plus x more; altogether there are 34. What

00:00:30.345 --> 00:00:35.235
is x? The answer is 23. x equals 34 minus 11 equals 23.
